Package: nbzinbSiam
Title: Negative Binomial and Zero-Inflated Negative Binomial Regression
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ashfak", "Siam", email = "siamk@miamioh.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits negative binomial regression by iteratively reweighted
    least squares (IRLS) alternated with Newton-Raphson updates of the
    dispersion parameter, and zero-inflated negative binomial regression
    by an EM algorithm whose M-steps are IRLS fits. No general-purpose
    optimizer is used.
